---
import { OperatorSchematic } from './OperatorSchematic';
---

<section id="profile" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-10 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] space-y-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-4">
    <div>
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[var(--accent)] mb-3">
        <span>// 02</span>
        <span>OPERATOR PROFILE &amp; DOMAIN FOUNDATION</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--text)]">
        Mechanical Foundation Meets Distributed Systems
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--muted)] mt-1.5 max-w-xl">
        Bridging factory-floor physical domain expertise with high-throughput streaming pipelines, low-latency microservices, and applied AI.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-start">
    {/* Left Column: Technical Blueprint Schematic Portrait */}
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 w-full max-w-md mx-auto lg:max-w-none">
      <OperatorSchematic />
    </div>

    {/* Right Column: Systems Narrative & Tactical Fieldnotes */}
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
      <div class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          I design and scale <strong class="text-[var(--text)] font-semibold">high-throughput backend microservices</strong>, <strong class="text-[var(--text)] font-semibold">real-time event-driven architectures</strong>, and responsive operational dashboards. My engineering background in mechanical systems gives me native fluency in machine kinematics, PLC telemetry, and sensor protocols that generic software engineers often struggle to decode.
        </p>
        <p>
          Impact is backed by production metrics: re-architecting continuous time-series models to <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold font-mono">cut storage costs by 70%</span>, engineering automated archive-based disaster recovery pipelines with <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold font-mono">zero data loss</span>, and sustaining <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold font-mono">99.9%+ uptime SLAs</span> across mission-critical enterprise installations.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Fieldnotes Checklist */}
      <div class="pt-2">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--accent-2)] font-semibold mb-3">
          Tactical Milestones &amp; Architectural Highlights
        </h3>

        <ul class="space-y-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--muted)]" aria-label="Fieldnotes">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] hover:border-[var(--accent)]/40 hover:bg-[var(--surface-hover)] transition-all">
            <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-bold shrink-0">FN-01</span>
            <div>
              <span class="text-[var(--text)] font-medium">Event-Driven Storage Re-Architecture</span>
              <span class="text-[var(--muted-dark)] block text-[11px] sm:inline sm:before:content-['—_']">
                Transitioned continuous time-series into on-change aggregated model (−70% storage, ↑ query throughput).
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] hover:border-[var(--accent)]/40 hover:bg-[var(--surface-hover)] transition-all">
            <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-bold shrink-0">FN-02</span>
            <div>
              <span class="text-[var(--text)] font-medium">Production Disaster Recovery System</span>
              <span class="text-[var(--muted-dark)] block text-[11px] sm:inline sm:before:content-['—_']">
                Architected daily archive-based backup &amp; restoration pipeline across MongoDB replica sets (zero data loss recovery).
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] hover:border-[var(--accent)]/40 hover:bg-[var(--surface-hover)] transition-all">
            <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-bold shrink-0">FN-03</span>
            <div>
              <span class="text-[var(--text)] font-medium">Private Container Distribution Infrastructure</span>
              <span class="text-[var(--muted-dark)] block text-[11px] sm:inline sm:before:content-['—_']">
                Deployed internal private Docker registry and multi-environment automated deployment pipeline.
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] hover:border-[var(--accent)]/40 hover:bg-[var(--surface-hover)] transition-all">
            <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-bold shrink-0">FN-04</span>
            <div>
              <span class="text-[var(--text)] font-medium">C-Suite &amp; Defence Sector Demonstrations</span>
              <span class="text-[var(--muted-dark)] block text-[11px] sm:inline sm:before:content-['—_']">
                Delivered live architecture showcases to plant heads and executive leadership at IMTEX and MSME Defence Expo.
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
